{"words": [{"text": "وَأَطِيعُوا۟", "translation": "And obey"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "وَأَطِيعُوا۟", "translation": "and obey"}, {"text": "ٱلرَّسُولَ", "translation": "the Messenger"}, {"text": "وَٱحْذَرُوا۟ ۚ", "translation": "and beware"}, {"text": "فَإِن", "translation": "And if"}, {"text": "تَوَلَّيْتُمْ", "translation": "you turn away"}, {"text": "فَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟", "translation": "then know"}, {"text": "أَنَّمَا", "translation": "only"}, {"text": "عَلَىٰ", "translation": "upon"}, {"text": "رَسُولِنَا", "translation": "Our Messenger"}, {"text": "ٱلْبَلَـٰغُ", "translation": "(is to) convey (the Message)"}, {"text": "ٱلْمُبِينُ", "translation": "clearly"}], "sahih": "And obey Allāh and obey the Messenger and beware. And if you turn away - then know that upon Our Messenger is only [the responsibility for] clear notification."}